[cliPerf]
!cliPerf [-s|-p] [-a] [filter] - displays system and/or performance data for clients of current game
"!cliPerf" displays system and performance data for all game clients currently connected
"!cliPerf -s" displays system information for all game clients currently connected
"!cliPerf -p" displays performance data for all game clients currently connected
"!cliPerf -a" displays system and performance data for all game clients, even if they disconnected
"!cliPerf foo" displays system and performance data for game clients currently connected matching name filter "foo"
"!cliPerf -a -p bar" displays performance data for game clients matching name filter "bar", even if they disconnected
